ops to fifth; Moll is now third.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":21,"text":"On lap 21 it was the turn of Chiron to refuel. He left after 1m28s.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":21,"text":"On lap 21 it was the turn of Chiron to refuel. He left after 1m28s.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":22,"text":"Varzi refueled on the following lap and started again after exactly one minute.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":22,"text":"Varzi refueled on the following lap and started again after exactly one minute.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":25,"text":"Wimille retired on lap 25 with a broken oil pipe.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":13},{"lap":25,"text":"Wimille retired on lap 25 with a broken oil pipe.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":13},{"lap":27,"text":"At the 27th lap Moll suffered another puncture at the right front tire which he changed at his pit in one minute.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":27,"text":"At the 27th lap Moll suffered another puncture at the right front tire which he changed at his pit in one minute.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":30,"text":"Hamilton retires at the pits with magneto trouble; Varzi and Chiron cross the line half a second apart.","q":false,"c":12},{"lap":30,"text":"Hamilton retires at the pits with magneto trouble; Varzi and Chiron cross the line half a second apart.","q":false,"c":12},{"lap":32,"text":"On lap 32, Chiron passed into the lead with Varzi remaining almost on his tail.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":32,"text":"On lap 32, Chiron passed into the lead with Varzi remaining almost on his tail.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":33,"text":"But on the following lap Varzi resumed the lead a hundred meters ahead of his teammate.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":33,"text":"But on the following lap Varzi resumed the lead a hundred meters ahead of his teammate.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":35,"text":"Chiron had slowed down and was now 26 seconds behind Varzi. Moll, on the other hand, was 'flying' - faster than the leading car.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":35,"text":"Chiron had slowed down and was now 26 seconds behind Varzi. Moll, on the other hand, was 'flying' - faster than the leading car.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":38,"text":"Chiron was again first on lap 38","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":38,"text":"Chiron was again first on lap 38","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":39,"text":"When passing the grandstand Varzi was first, followed after only 100 meters by Moll, while Chiron had fallen far behind due to dropping oil pressure.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":39,"text":"When passing the grandstand Varzi was first, followed after only 100 meters by Moll, while Chiron had fallen far behind due to dropping oil pressure.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":40,"text":"Moll tries the inside at the last curve; Varzi squeezes him and wins by one wheel, Chiron third.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":40,"text":"Moll tries the inside at the last curve; Varzi squeezes him and wins by one wheel, Chiron third.","q":false,"c":0}]}